{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"electerm.electerm","latestVersion":"5.10.0","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.d9ba5ff2.png","priority":1,"sha256":"d9ba5ff2fe8199598abca990e499aa988e3aac07fd3228319c7f30ebe772cbe8","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"author":"ZHAO Xudong","copyright":"Copyright (c) 2017~tomorrow electerm, ZHAO Xudong","copyrightUrl":"https://github.com/electerm/electerm/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","description":"Terminal/ssh/sftp/ftp/telnet/serialport/RDP/VNC/Spice client(Linux, windows, MacOS, iOS, Android, HarmonyOS)","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/electerm/electerm/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"author":"ZHAO Xudong","copyright":"Copyright (c) 2017~tomorrow electerm, ZHAO Xudong","copyrightUrl":"https://github.com/electerm/electerm/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","description":"Terminal/ssh/sftp/ftp/telnet/serialport/RDP/VNC/Spice client(Linux, windows, MacOS, iOS, Android, HarmonyOS)","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/electerm/electerm/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Terminal/ssh/sftp/ftp/telnet/serialport/RDP/VNC/Spice client(Linux, windows, MacOS, iOS, Android, HarmonyOS)","moniker":"electerm","name":"electerm","packageUrl":"https://electerm.org/","privacyUrl":"https://github.com/electerm/electerm/wiki/privacy-notice","publisher":"ZHAO Xudong","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/electerm/electerm/issues","publisherUrl":"https://electerm.org/","releaseNotes":"Major updates\n- Widgets: a new \"Online\" tab browses the widgets.electerm.org registry and installs a widget in one click. Before installing, it shows the source repository, pinned commit and file list for review, warns that a widget's main.js runs with full Node privileges, and verifies every downloaded file against the registry hash; revoked widgets are flagged\nBug fixes\n- Security: HTTP Basic credentials entered in a web-session tab are now bound to the origin they were typed for, so cross-origin requests and redirects no longer receive them; guest permission checks are denied as well (GHSA-3mh6-qf3v-q6cr)\n- Fix AI presets still offering retired Gemini and Claude models, replaced with current ones (#4716) by @pcbeingused333\n重大更新\n- 小组件：新增「在线」标签页，可浏览 widgets.electerm.org 目录并一键安装。安装前会展示来源仓库、锁定的 commit 与文件列表供确认，并提示小组件的 main.js 会以完整 Node 权限运行；安装时会按目录哈希校验每个文件，已撤销的小组件会给出提示\n问题修复\n- 安全：修复 Web 会话标签中输入的 HTTP Basic 凭据会被附加到该标签所有请求（包括跨站请求与重定向）的问题，现在凭据仅用于输入时对应的 origin；同时补齐访客权限检查的拦截 (GHSA-3mh6-qf3v-q6cr)\n- 修复 AI 预设中仍提供已下线的 Gemini / Claude 模型的问题，更新为当前可用模型 (#4716)（由 @pcbeingused333 提供）\nDownload下载: https://electerm.org","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/electerm/electerm/releases/tag/v5.10.0","tags":["developer-tools","file-manager","powershell","rdp","serialport","sftp","shell","spice","ssh","telnet","terminal","utilities","vnc","wsl"]}},"longDescription":"Terminal/ssh/sftp/ftp/telnet/serialport/RDP/VNC/Spice client(Linux, windows, MacOS, iOS, Android, HarmonyOS)","moniker":"electerm","name":"electerm","packageUrl":"https://electerm.org/","privacyUrl":"https://github.com/electerm/electerm/wiki/privacy-notice","publisher":"ZHAO Xudong","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/electerm/electerm/issues","publisherUrl":"https://electerm.org/","releaseNotes":"Major updates\n- Widgets: a new \"Online\" tab browses the widgets.electerm.org registry and installs a widget in one click. Before installing, it shows the source repository, pinned commit and file list for review, warns that a widget's main.js runs with full Node privileges, and verifies every downloaded file against the registry hash; revoked widgets are flagged\nBug fixes\n- Security: HTTP Basic credentials entered in a web-session tab are now bound to the origin they were typed for, so cross-origin requests and redirects no longer receive them; guest permission checks are denied as well (GHSA-3mh6-qf3v-q6cr)\n- Fix AI presets still offering retired Gemini and Claude models, replaced with current ones (#4716) by @pcbeingused333\n重大更新\n- 小组件：新增「在线」标签页，可浏览 widgets.electerm.org 目录并一键安装。安装前会展示来源仓库、锁定的 commit 与文件列表供确认，并提示小组件的 main.js 会以完整 Node 权限运行；安装时会按目录哈希校验每个文件，已撤销的小组件会给出提示\n问题修复\n- 安全：修复 Web 会话标签中输入的 HTTP Basic 凭据会被附加到该标签所有请求（包括跨站请求与重定向）的问题，现在凭据仅用于输入时对应的 origin；同时补齐访客权限检查的拦截 (GHSA-3mh6-qf3v-q6cr)\n- 修复 AI 预设中仍提供已下线的 Gemini / Claude 模型的问题，更新为当前可用模型 (#4716)（由 @pcbeingused333 提供）\nDownload下载: https://electerm.org","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/electerm/electerm/releases/tag/v5.10.0","tags":["developer-tools","file-manager","powershell","rdp","serialport","sftp","shell","spice","ssh","telnet","terminal","utilities","vnc","wsl"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/5.10.0/app.json","detailSha256":"04fa6eadd72297e219427b292cfdb2b851131240dff2d7a27883bec88b06a7c6","releaseDate":"2026-11-09","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"5.10.0"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/5.9.0/app.json","detailSha256":"a04d97d6aacee8e75e675451bc93738404786895a2b60bd8b349d3e4f28ebe17","releaseDate":"2026-11-07","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"5.9.0"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/5.8.0/app.json","detailSha256":"970b1a4eb3c0a1d82927c8b2dc8aec60f4fad9359f7edab85143b8b7e23b6068","releaseDate":"2026-10-30","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"5.8.0"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/5.7.21/app.json","detailSha256":"c60a8774dbcfdbcdb32b16c46a582c4968abdafd4ff5042622c4bbda2efeff6f","releaseDate":"2026-10-27","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"5.7.21"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/5.7.15/app.json","detailSha256":"b10f62f4cc85127246076e98f927317d8293e1df0b8df73a2419a2be0d2d6836","releaseDate":"2026-10-26","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"5.7.15"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/5.7.5/app.json","detailSha256":"b9be9e426fd9d24015e309e002cd8f49167